      "writtenOn": "2022-04-25T14:35:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note that if the cutoff happens within a bucket, removeBucketsBefore will not remove that bucket:\n\n            // cutoff happens before or during this bucket; everything before\n            // this bucket should be removed.\n            if (curEnd \u003e cutoff) break;\n\nDoes that affect the correctness of the importer?\n\nIf so, can we do anything about that? Perhaps scale the data usage of this bucket down by a factor equal to (bucketStart[0] + bucketduration - cutoff) / bucketDuration?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 709,
        "startChar": 20,
        "endLine": 709,
        "endChar": 39
      },
      "revId": "6470608bdd085d0b46134b488589d389960f9245",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
