      "writtenOn": "2022-05-09T08:52:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, this would be a problem.\nIIUC we should remove anything \"starts before cutoff\" instead, which is potentially the imported data.\nI don\u0027t think scale the usage would be a good solution, given that if the process is triggered multiple times, the overlapping part might be counted multiple times.\nThe best we can do is to remove the overlapping part I think.\n\nRevised as suggested in aosp/2003670. See if it works for you.",
      "parentUuid": "a75a85a8_96f78a27",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 709,
        "startChar": 20,
